  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Repro steps:\n1. Start VRChat in desktop mode.\n2. Open settings menu. press \"LOGOUT\" button.\n3. Close the window\n4. Start VRChat in desktop mode again.\n5. Then it shows \"Welcome to the world of VRChat\" dialog without a mouse cursor.\nThere are some buttons on the view. But it's hard to press the button you desired without a mouse cursor. I think this is very bad especially for newcomers.\nWorkaround: Keep pressing `TAB` key, then the mouse cursor of Windows shows up. Click somewhere of the window, then the mouse cursor of VRChat (in cyan arrow style) appears.",
